Apex Classes
Class	Purpose
TpmArchitectureHubController	Connects the LWC to Apex services to retrieve assessment data, cycles, and portfolio details.
TpmArchitectureHubAssessmentService	Retrieves Salesforce assessment data, manages Active/Locked/Published/Inactive cycles, and calculates the data used by the dashboard.
TpmArchitectureHubPlatformController	Connects the LWC to the Platform Strategy service.
TpmArchitectureHubPlatformService	Retrieves platform information from TPM_Platform__c for Platform Strategy.
TpmArchitectureHubSchema	Validates Salesforce object metadata and accessibility before querying platform data.

Lightning Web Components
LWC	Purpose
tpmArchitectureHub	Main component displaying the Enterprise Dashboard, Portfolio Health, Application Explorer, cycle dropdown, and navigation.
tpmStackedBarChart	Displays Red, Yellow, and Green health distribution as a stacked bar chart.
tpmScoreBarChart	Displays numerical assessment ratings as visual score bars.

Aura Component
Component	Purpose
TPMArchitectureHubPrototype	Hosts the main tpmArchitectureHub LWC as a standalone Salesforce application.
